      "filename": "Argentine Command Post on Mount Longdon (51066405326).jpg",
      "title": "File:Argentine Command Post on Mount Longdon (51066405326).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/Argentine_Command_Post_on_Mount_Longdon_%2851066405326%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
